---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import Box from '../seqflow/Box.astro';
import Op from '../seqflow/Op.astro';
import Arrow from '../seqflow/Arrow.astro';
import Badge from '../seqflow/Badge.astro';
import Stepper from '../seqflow/Stepper.astro';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

// The SAGAN self-attention block (Zhang et al., 2019, Eqs. 1–3), in the colours of the sequence-model figures:
// the input feature map green, the 1×1 convolutions and the attention map amber, intermediate maps blue, the output red.
// f(x) = W_f x, g(x) = W_g x, h(x) = W_h x have C̄ = C/8 channels; β_{j,i} = softmax_i(f(x_i)ᵀ g(x_j));
// o_j = W_v Σ_i β_{j,i} h(x_i) has C channels; y = γ o + x with γ learned and initialized at 0.
const t = ru
  ? {
      fmap: 'C × N', conv: 'свёртка 1×1', small: 'C̄ × N', nn: 'N × N', out: 'γo + x', skip: 'x (обход)', init: 'в начале γ = 0',
      steps: [
        'три свёртки 1×1 переводят карту признаков x в f(x) и g(x) с C̄ = C/8 каналами и в h(x) с C̄ каналами',
        'оценки s_ij = f(x_i)ᵀ g(x_j) для всех пар позиций; softmax по i превращает каждую строку карты N × N в веса β_j,i с суммой 1',
        'o_j = W_v Σ_i β_j,i h(x_i): каждая позиция j получает взвешенную сумму значений со всех N позиций, возвращённую к C каналам',
        'y = γo + x; γ обучается и начинается с 0, поэтому блок сначала тождественный и подмешивает дальние признаки по мере роста γ',
      ],
    }
  : {
      fmap: 'C × N', conv: '1×1 conv', small: 'C̄ × N', nn: 'N × N', out: 'γo + x', skip: 'x (skip)', init: 'γ = 0 at init',
      steps: [
        'three 1×1 convolutions map the feature map x to f(x) and g(x) with C̄ = C/8 channels and to h(x) with C̄ channels',
        'scores s_ij = f(x_i)ᵀ g(x_j) for every pair of positions; a softmax over i turns each row of the N × N map into weights β_j,i that sum to 1',
        'o_j = W_v Σ_i β_j,i h(x_i): every position j receives a weighted sum of values from all N positions, mapped back to C channels',
        'y = γo + x; γ is learned and starts at 0, so the block starts as the identity and lets in distant evidence as γ grows',
      ],
    };
const id = 'gan-scaling-self-attention';
---

<Figure
  id={id}
  title={ru ? 'Блок self-attention в SAGAN' : 'The SAGAN self-attention block'}
  caption={ru
    ? 'Зелёное — входная карта признаков x с C каналами и N = H·W позициями; жёлтое — обучаемые свёртки 1×1 и карта внимания β; синее — промежуточные карты; красное — выход блока. Строка j карты β задаёт веса, с которыми позиция j собирает значения h(x_i) со всех позиций i. γ начинается с 0, поэтому вначале блок — тождественное отображение. C̄ = C/8.'
    : 'Green: the input feature map x, C channels at N = H·W positions; amber: learned 1×1 convolutions and the attention map β; blue: intermediate maps; red: the output. Row j of β weights the values h(x_i) that position j gathers from every position i. γ starts at 0, so the block starts as the identity. C̄ = C/8.'}
>
  <!-- Wide layout: the three branches f, g, h run left to right; the skip connection goes over the top. -->
  <svg class="fig-wide" viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-w-t ${id}-w-d`}>
    <title id={`${id}-w-t`}>{ru ? 'Поток данных через блок self-attention' : 'Data flow through the self-attention block'}</title>
    <desc id={`${id}-w-d`}>{ru
      ? 'Слева карта признаков x. Три свёртки 1×1 W_f, W_g, W_h дают f(x), g(x) и h(x). f(x) и g(x) сходятся в softmax, который даёт карту внимания β размера N на N. β умножается на h(x), результат через W_v даёт o. o умножается на γ и складывается с x, пришедшим по обходной связи сверху; получается выход y.'
      : 'On the left the feature map x. Three 1×1 convolutions W_f, W_g, W_h give f(x), g(x) and h(x). f(x) and g(x) meet in a softmax that gives the N by N attention map beta. Beta multiplies h(x), and the result passes through W_v to give o. o is multiplied by gamma and added to x, which arrives through a skip connection over the top; the sum is the output y.'}</desc>
    <g data-s="1">
      <Box x={14} y={124} w={96} h={46} label="x" sub={t.fmap} tone="x" />
      <Arrow pts={[[110, 147], [130, 147], [130, 63], [146, 63]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[130, 147], [146, 147]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[130, 147], [130, 253], [146, 253]]} />
      <Box x={148} y={40} w={80} h={46} label="W_f" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={21} />
      <Box x={148} y={124} w={80} h={46} label="W_g" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={21} />
      <Box x={148} y={230} w={80} h={46} label="W_h" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={21} />
      <Arrow pts={[[228, 63], [248, 63]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[228, 147], [248, 147]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[228, 253], [248, 253]]} />
      <Box x={250} y={40} w={92} h={46} label="f(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" />
      <Box x={250} y={124} w={92} h={46} label="g(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" />
      <Box x={250} y={230} w={92} h={46} label="h(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" />
    </g>
    <Badge x={186} y={110} n={1} />
    <g data-s="2">
      <Arrow pts={[[342, 63], [362, 63], [362, 105], [394, 105]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[342, 147], [362, 147], [362, 105]]} head={false} />
      <Op x={430} y={105} sym="softmax" tone="amber" />
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x={378} y={136}>s = f(x)ᵀ g(x)</text>
      <Arrow pts={[[464, 105], [488, 105]]} tone="amber" />
      <Box x={490} y={82} w={96} h={46} label="β" sub={t.nn} tone="g" />
    </g>
    <Badge x={430} y={70} n={2} />
    <g data-s="3">
      <Arrow pts={[[538, 128], [538, 238]]} tone="amber" />
      <Arrow pts={[[342, 253], [523, 253]]} />
      <Op x={538} y={253} sym="×" />
      <Arrow pts={[[551, 253], [576, 253]]} label="W_v" at={[563, 244]} anchor="middle" />
      <Box x={578} y={230} w={62} h={46} label="o" sub="C × N" tone="h" />
    </g>
    <Badge x={510} y={292} n={3} />
    <g data-s="4">
      <Arrow pts={[[640, 253], [655, 253]]} />
      <Op x={671} y={253} sym="·γ" tone="amber" />
      <Arrow pts={[[671, 240], [671, 162]]} />
      <path class="f-line f-muted" d="M 62 124 L 62 16 L 671 16 L 671 132" marker-end="url(#f-arrow-muted)" />
      <text class="f-small f-t-green f-halo" x={300} y={12} text-anchor="middle">{t.skip}</text>
      <Op x={671} y={147} sym="+" />
      <Arrow pts={[[684, 147], [694, 147]]} />
      <Box x={696} y={124} w={58} h={46} label="y" sub={t.out} tone="y" />
      <text class="f-small f-t-amber" x={671} y={296} text-anchor="middle">{t.init}</text>
    </g>
    <Badge x={724} y={205} n={4} />
  </svg>

  <!-- Narrow layout: the branches run top to bottom; the skip connection runs down the left edge. -->
  <svg class="fig-narrow seq-narrow" viewBox="0 0 360 560" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-n-t ${id}-n-d`}>
    <title id={`${id}-n-t`}>{ru ? 'Поток данных через блок self-attention' : 'Data flow through the self-attention block'}</title>
    <desc id={`${id}-n-d`}>{ru
      ? 'Сверху карта признаков x. Под ней три свёртки 1×1 и карты f(x), g(x), h(x). f(x) и g(x) сходятся в softmax, который даёт карту внимания β. β умножается на h(x), через W_v получается o; o умножается на γ и складывается с x, пришедшим по обходной связи слева; внизу выход y.'
      : 'At the top the feature map x. Below it three 1×1 convolutions and the maps f(x), g(x), h(x). f(x) and g(x) meet in a softmax that gives the attention map beta. Beta multiplies h(x), W_v gives o; o is multiplied by gamma and added to x, which arrives through a skip connection on the left; the output y is at the bottom.'}</desc>
    <g data-s="1">
      <Box x={130} y={24} w={100} h={50} label="x" sub={t.fmap} tone="x" subGap={19} />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 74], [180, 92], [62, 92], [62, 108]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 92], [180, 108]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 92], [298, 92], [298, 108]]} />
      <Box x={14} y={110} w={96} h={50} label="W_f" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={23} />
      <Box x={132} y={110} w={96} h={50} label="W_g" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={23} />
      <Box x={250} y={110} w={96} h={50} label="W_h" sub={t.conv} tone="g" subGap={23} />
      <Arrow pts={[[62, 160], [62, 186]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 160], [180, 186]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[298, 160], [298, 186]]} />
      <Box x={14} y={188} w={96} h={50} label="f(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" subGap={19} />
      <Box x={132} y={188} w={96} h={50} label="g(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" subGap={19} />
      <Box x={250} y={188} w={96} h={50} label="h(x)" sub={t.small} tone="h" subGap={19} />
    </g>
    <Badge x={121} y={135} n={1} />
    <g data-s="2">
      <Arrow pts={[[62, 238], [62, 252], [120, 252], [120, 265]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 238], [180, 252], [120, 252]]} head={false} />
      <Op x={120} y={280} sym="softmax" tone="amber" />
      <Arrow pts={[[120, 293], [120, 308]]} tone="amber" />
      <Box x={72} y={310} w={96} h={50} label="β" sub={t.nn} tone="g" subGap={19} />
    </g>
    <Badge x={40} y={300} n={2} />
    <g data-s="3">
      <Arrow pts={[[298, 238], [298, 320]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[168, 335], [285, 335]]} tone="amber" />
      <Op x={298} y={335} sym="×" />
      <Arrow pts={[[298, 348], [298, 376]]} label="W_v" at={[308, 368]} />
      <Box x={250} y={378} w={96} h={50} label="o" sub="C × N" tone="h" subGap={19} />
    </g>
    <Badge x={228} y={305} n={3} />
    <g data-s="4">
      <Arrow pts={[[298, 428], [298, 447]]} />
      <Op x={298} y={462} sym="·γ" tone="amber" />
      <Arrow pts={[[283, 462], [195, 462]]} />
      <path class="f-line f-muted" d="M 130 49 L 6 49 L 6 462 L 165 462" marker-end="url(#f-arrow-muted)" />
      <text class="f-small f-t-green f-halo" x={10} y={420}>{t.skip}</text>
      <Op x={180} y={462} sym="+" />
      <Arrow pts={[[180, 475], [180, 496]]} />
      <Box x={130} y={498} w={100} h={50} label="y" sub={t.out} tone="y" subGap={19} />
      <text class="f-small f-t-amber" x={298} y={500} text-anchor="middle">{t.init}</text>
    </g>
    <Badge x={340} y={440} n={4} />
  </svg>
  <Stepper steps={t.steps} />
</Figure>
